SKILLS-PATHS|skills|--paths prints canonical representatives; --copies expands matching files; --aliases adds aliases for returned files without increasing copies.|test_skills.py::test_paths_aliases*;test_skills_content.py::test_identical*;test_skills_content.py::test_content_versions*|SKILLS-workflow
SKILLS-LIMIT|skills|Text/JSON default to 20 groups, paths defaults to all, -n limits results, zero lifts the cap, and totals remain accurate.|test_skills.py::test_bounded_output*;test_skills.py::test_exact_qualified*|
SKILLS-JSON|skills|JSON includes skills, total, unique, files, complete, errors, coverage, indexed_at, cycles_skipped and index path.|test_skills.py::test_cycles_missing*;test_skills.py::test_bounded_output*;test_skills_content.py::test_identical*|
SKILLS-FRESHNESS|skills|Warm lookups validate matching files without rediscovery; edits are rehashed before grouping; new installations require --index.|test_skills.py::test_warm_lookup*;test_skills.py::test_reindex_discovers*;test_skills_content.py::test_changed_copy*|SKILLS-workflow
SKILLS-VANISHED|skills|Reindex omits vanished paths, old poisoned maps repair stale missing-file diagnostics, and changed/deleted matching paths request a reindex.|test_skills_vanished.py::*;test_skills_content.py::test_deleted_representative*;test_skills.py::test_changed_alias*|
SKILLS-ERRORS|skills|Missing explicit roots, permission errors, changing hashes and retargeted aliases report incomplete discovery and exit 2; ordinary lookup diagnostics are bounded.|test_skills.py::test_cycles_missing*;test_skills.py::test_discovery_retries*;test_skills_content.py::test_unreadable*;test_skills_content.py::test_changed_while*;test_skills_vanished.py::test_permission*|
SKILLS-HASH-RETRY|skills|Transient changes while hashing are retried; stable file signatures reuse hashes on reindex.|test_skills_content.py::test_file_that_changes*;test_skills_content.py::test_changed_copy*|
SKILLS-MAP|skills|The map persists across upgrades, migrates supported old versions, rebuilds corrupt data and is replaced atomically.|test_skills.py::test_corrupt_map*;test_skills.py::test_old_default_map*;test_skills_content.py::test_version_two*;test_skills_content.py::test_corrupt_hash*|
SKILLS-CLEAR|skills|--clear removes the default map and remembered roots; SXR_NO_CACHE scans without saving a map.|test_skills.py::test_uncached_lookup_and_clear|SKILLS-workflow
