INIT-GLOBAL|init|--global chooses existing ~/.agents/AGENTS.md, then ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md, then ~/AGENTS.md.|test_init.py::test_global_target*;test_init.py::test_global_writes*|
INIT-IDEMPOTENT|init|--write appends/replaces only the marked block, preserves neighboring prose, and becomes byte-identical on a second invocation.|test_init.py::test_write_appends*;test_init.py::test_write_replaces*;test_init.py::test_write_twice*;test_init.py::test_write_on*|INIT-workflow
INIT-CHECK|init|--check returns 0 for the current version, 1 for missing/stale blocks, and reports version drift.|test_init.py::test_check_is_quiet*;test_init.py::test_check_exits_1*;test_init.py::test_check_names*|INIT-workflow
