BUILD-MACOS-ARM64|distribution|A freshly built macOS arm64 archive relocates successfully and works without system Python or Homebrew on PATH.||
BUILD-OTHER-PLATFORMS|distribution|macOS x86_64 and Linux arm64/x86_64 archives run on the documented macOS/Ubuntu hosts.||
INSTALL-HOMEBREW|distribution|The Homebrew formula installs/updates the matching prebuilt bundle without compiling a Python/OpenSSL dependency chain.||
